            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA ow'amahe naagamba ati, “Ndituma omukwenda wange anteekanirize omuhanda, MUKAMA ou murukuserra, nubwo aliija omunju ye atalengeriirwe; omukwenda ou murukwegomba kurora aliija arangirre endagaano yange.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOL.2.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yow 2:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.6.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kus 6:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu n'oha alisobora kwemera ekiro eki aliiziraho kandi obu alizooka n'oha alyemerra? Habwokuba alisisana nk'omurro gw'omuntu anyakusemeza ezaabbu, alisisana nk'esabbuni ey'omwogi w'engoye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aliikarra nk'omuntu anyakusemeza efeeza kugimaramu ebyenga, alisemeza abaana ba Leevi basisane nk'ezaabbu n'efeeza, okuhika obu balikaleetera MUKAMA ebihongwa ebimusemeriire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu, ebihongwa abantu ba Yuda n'aba Yerusaalemu ebi baleetera MUKAMA, nubwo birimusemereza nkooku byamusemerezaaga kara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA ow'amahe naagamba ati, “Ndiija mbacwere omusango ndiba kaiso arukurahuka kurumiriza abarogo, abasiihani, abanyakurahirra busa, abahenderra abakozi empeera yabo, abanyakuhenderra abafaakati n'enfuuzi, abanyakunyaga abasi b'ensi ebi basemeriire kutunga, n'abatantiina.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okusasura kimu kya ikumi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
